<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Telerj 10-mo net 69.9 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Telerj 10-mo net 69.9 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian state-owned telecom Telerj, a unit of the federal Telebras system serving Rio de Janeiro state, released the following 10-month 1996 net profit.</p>
<p>			Jan-Oct 1996	Jan-Oct 1995</p>
<p>    Net		  69.95 million	   N/A</p>
<p>    Net Revs	   1.050 bln	   N/A</p>
<p>    Gross Revs	 1.394 bln	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE: The figures are all in Brazilian reais and are not adjusted for inflation.</p>
<p>Telerj's formal name is Telecomunicacoes do Rio de Janeiro SA.</p>
<p>-- James Craig, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 248 5413</p>
</text>
